  "card_excerpt": "London's Calling. Answer the Call!",
  "hero_image": "_MG_1079.jpg",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>You have to love ol' London town. It's a great city, and is home to a lot of really special place. In this post you'll see a few museums, a couple of hot spots, and some a-ok places to eat and drink!</p>"
    },
