    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Most museums in London are free to enter. Something about hopping and bopping from museum to museum is really fun and exciting. Some of our favorites were T<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nationalgallery.org.uk/\">he National Gallery</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.npg.org.uk/\">The National Portrait Gallery</a>, the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.tate.org.uk/visit/tate-modern\">Tate Modern</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.vam.ac.uk/\">V&amp;A</a>, and for a taste of the strange, the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://wellcomecollection.org/\">Wellcome Collection</a>.</p>"
    },
