    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Now there're a lot of problems in the world, but I do think that we'd get along a bit better if there were more spots around like <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://drinkshopdo.co.uk/\">Drink, Shop &amp; Do</a>. In short, folks get together here to drink booze, peruse hand-made crafts in the store, and sit around communal tables to drunkenly make art (and crafts) together.&nbsp;Kellyn was in heaven!</p>"
    },
