    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Prior to visiting London I heard a lot about <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://boroughmarket.org.uk/\">Borough Market</a>. Turns out, it definitely lives up to the hype. Not only that, there are some seriously great cheese shops and pubs in the nearby area. For example, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.theglobeboroughmarket.com/\">Globe Tavern</a> is a sweet spot to grab a pint. Word on the street is that this is where Bridget from <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.telegraph.co.uk/property/buy/could-bridget-jones-still-afford-that-flat-above-borough-market/\">Bridget Jones Diaries</a> would pour one back in the movies!</p>"
    },
