    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>There are tons of great places to see and things to do in London. The signage is especially fun. Give Away, Cockfosters, Sheer Drops, and of course, Mind the Gap.... London has it all!</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "gallery",
      "columns": 2,
      "images": [
        {
