        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>One of the A+ recommendations we received was to visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://gordonswinebar.com/\">Gordon's Wine Bar</a>. It's in a bit of a touristy area down by the Thames, but gee does it set the mood and boy is it easy on the eyes. If you feel like drinking some fermented grape juice like it's 1890, this is your spot!</p>"
    },
