    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Over near the Wellcome Collection, there's a great little pub called <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.breelouise.pub/\">Bree Louise</a>&nbsp;that serves award-winning ale and cider in an authentic pub atmosphere. I had a terrific handmade pie and a nice, cloudy cider while chilling out there. It's a pub in the true sense - a public place for the young and old alike to get together to talk, laugh, and drink.&nbsp;Also, the place is carpeted, which for some reason made me really happy.</p>"
    },
