        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>A friend's parents recommended going on a Jack the Ripper murder mystery <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.jack-the-ripper-tour.com/\">walking tour</a>. Because we were running late, we had to run about 20 minutes straight to make it on time. The tour was super fun, and appropriately touristy. The final stop is a hipster pub called <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.tripsavvy.com/the-ten-bells-pub-london-1583136\">The Ten Bells</a> where Jack himself used to gaze at his soon-to-be victims, Annie Chapman and Mary Kelly,&nbsp;while they drank pomegranate margaritas (j/k).&nbsp;</p>"
    },
